WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.741
Welcome to our video tutorial on seller-fulfilled prime, also known as SFP.

00:00:06.741 --> 00:00:14.000
In this introductory video, we will go over program specific details, including eligibility requirements.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.652
One of the key benefits for SFP sellers is getting prime branding on eligible offers, while fulfilling

00:00:20.652 --> 00:00:23.000
orders directly from their own warehouse.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Sellers will ship orders same day with free one and two-day shipping to Amazon Prime customers.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.727
When you enroll products in seller-fulfilled prime, the prime badge will be added next to your products

00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:37.000
in the Amazon store.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.273
This makes your products more discoverable, and prime customers know that you're able to offer fast,

00:00:44.273 --> 00:00:47.000
reliable delivery and excellent customer service.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.611
In order to enroll products in seller-fulfilled prime, you need to meet the following pre-qualification

00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:54.000
criteria.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
If you meet these requirements, you're able to start your seller-fulfilled prime trial.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.833
First, the default shipping address connected to your selling account must be a domestic U.

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:05.222
S.

00:01:05.222 --> 00:01:06.000
shipping address.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Second, you need to have a professional selling account.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.263
Third, you need to have fulfilled 100 orders and meet the shipping performance bar over the past

00:01:16.263 --> 00:01:17.000
90 days.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Specifically, that means that your cancellation rate can't be higher than 2.5%.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:31.579
Your valid tracking rate needs to be greater than 95%, and your late shipment rate is less than

00:01:31.579 --> 00:01:32.000
4%.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.478
You can find these metrics in your account health dashboard.

00:01:35.478 --> 00:01:40.000
You can access the dashboard by clicking on the Seller Central Main Menu.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Go to Performance and click on Account Health.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Your shipping performance metrics are then displayed in the far right column.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.120
Please note that the pre-qualification requirements that allow you to enroll in the trial are different

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.000
from the requirements during the actual trial period.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.000
You're ready to enroll in the Seller-fulfilled prime trial.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.636
First, navigate to sellercentral.

00:02:05.636 --> 00:02:06.545
amazon.

00:02:06.545 --> 00:02:12.000
com/seller-fulfilled-prime/register/welcome.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.800
If you meet all pre-qualification requirements, you'll be able to enroll in the trial by entering

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.000
your account information.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
This includes your company's name, your phone number, and your email address.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.000
You'll also need to choose your primary warehouse address.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.760
In order to be eligible for the Seller-fulfilled prime trial, remember that your warehouse address

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.920
needs to have a domestic U.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:37.280
S.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.000
shipping address.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.000
After you have entered the information, click Save Changes.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.000
On the next page, agree to program policies and proceed.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:52.000
After you've successfully registered for the trial, make sure to continue watching our video

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.000
on the requirements during the Seller-fulfilled prime trial period.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Thank you, and happy selling in the Amazon store.
